1. Definitions
----------------------------------------------------------------------------

"Software" means the ORBCAFE UI source code, object code, documentation,
examples, themes, and related assets distributed in this repository and in
the `orbcafe-ui` npm package.

"Licensor" means ORBCAFE, the owner and maintainer of the Software.

"You" means the individual or legal entity exercising rights under this
license.

"Internal Business Use" means use of the Software by You or by employees
and contractors of Your organization, solely to build and operate
applications, websites, portals, dashboards, and tools that are used
internally by Your organization and that are not themselves sold, licensed,
subscribed to, or delivered to third parties as software products or paid
deliverables. Internal Business Use remains Internal Business Use
regardless of the size, revenue, or corporate form of Your organization.

"Community Use" means any of the following:

  (a) Personal Use: use by individuals for personal projects, learning,
      experimentation, and hobby development;
  (b) Educational and Research Use: use in teaching, coursework, academic
      research, and non-commercial scientific work;
  (c) Evaluation Use: use to develop, test, prototype, demonstrate, or
      evaluate the Software, including proofs of concept;
  (d) Internal Business Use as defined above;
  (e) Non-commercial Community Projects: use in projects that are not
      sold, licensed, subscribed to, or delivered for a fee, and that do
      not form part of a commercial software product.

"Commercial Product Use" means any use of the Software that is not
Community Use, including without limitation the uses listed in Section 3.

